{
  "corpusVersion": "1",
  "description": "FR-OFF-041 Hybrid Logical Clock. Every expectation is hand-derived from the algorithm as printed in SRS 21.7, never from an implementation's output. Nodes: A = the receiving clock, B = a remote device, C = a second device chosen so that C < A < B lexicographically.",
